      "title": "File:Tunnsjøen from Skorovatn.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cb/Tunnsj%C3%B8en_from_Skorovatn.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
